{"id":"u-694d6092-024f-47f8-9940-51d10df928b6","src":"community","title":"5-Day Home Training","author":"","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/d8iq2J-3-days-home-exercise","desc":"This 5-day at-home dumbbell and bench program is designed to build muscle, improve strength, and enhance definition using minimal equipment. It focuses on compound and isolation movements to ensure balanced development, efficiency, and progressive overload while maintaining flexibility for different fitness levels.\n\nWeek Progression Plan\n\t•\tWeeks 1-8: Stick to core exercises with linear weight progression and focus on mastering tempo and range of motion.\n\t•\tWeeks 9-16: Introduce variations (e.g., incline/decline bench, unilateral movements), increase volume, and incorporate advanced techniques for challenge and growth.\n\nKey Adjustments from Weeks 1-8 that will be seen in Weeks 9-16:\n\n✅ Drop Sets & AMRAP – To increase intensity.\n✅ Tempo Manipulation – Slow negatives and pauses to increase tension.\n✅ Unilateral Movements – To improve control and stability.\n✅ Supersets – To make workouts more time-efficient and challenging.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Women's","Bodyweight Fitness"],"equipment":["Dumbbell Only"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T13:41:54.613Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Chest, Shoulders & Triceps","Legs & Core","Back & Biceps","Legs & Core (Variation)","Upper Body"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Shoulder Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Skull Crusher (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":4}]},{"n":"Tricep Kickback","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Goblet Squat","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":4}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"x":4}]}